==Battleground==
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ryoga Hibiki (Enemy)|Ryoga Hibiki]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

